::Q001::[markdown]masc./fem. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust”:{
	~%-100%ἄδικ#Incorrect. **ἄδικ** is the neut. nom. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἀδίκους#Incorrect. **ἀδίκους** is the masc./fem. acc. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἄδικοι#Incorrect. **ἄδικοι** is the masc./fem. nom. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἄδικος#Incorrect. **ἄδικος** is the masc./fem. nom. sing. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%100%ἀδίκων#Correct: **ἀδίκων** is the correct form for masc./fem. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἄδικον#Incorrect. **ἄδικον** is the masc./fem. acc. sing. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἄδικα#Incorrect. **ἄδικα** is the neut. acc. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἀδίκοις#Incorrect. **ἀδίκοις** is the neut. dat. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
}


